From 527fe2bc24f954b26c0485c90345f237ce39a09d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bradley Gleave <bradley@bradleytgpcoaching.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 04:51:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] S8-C: native reconstruct writers for clients, workouts,
 programs, client_history

Register the native families in the reconstruct registry, route staged step
tokens through the existing resolveStep, return a typed persist result with
atomic ledger target_kind propagation, and add the additive optional
programs mapping rules member. Includes native unit specs and the
candidate-bound G2 S8-C RLS proof driver files (proof not run in this commit).
